  "releaseNotes": "Introduces the DevOp Jira Cloud client package.\n      - Adds typed services for issues, worklogs, spaces, users, metadata, and JQL helpers\n      - Adds fluent issue and worklog query builders with LINQ-to-JQL translation\n      - Adds Jira Cloud search support using nextPageToken paging\n      - Adds Markdown and Jira ADF conversion for descriptions and comments\n      - Adds custom field mapping, dependency injection, retry, and package assets",
